cmsk8qjlh0011v7pgsi4u4egp	cmrme14qy0000v73cxe80pwn0	\N	\N	AgriShield AI	Agriculture faces major challenges such as crop diseases, pest attacks, unpredictable weather conditions, and inefficient resource usage. Early detection of crop diseases is difficult, and existing solutions often depend on cloud connectivity, making them less reliable in rural areas.\nAgriShield AI is an Edge AI-based smart agriculture system that focuses on early crop disease detection using TinyML and a camera module. The system performs on-device disease analysis using the VEGA Processor, enabling faster detection without depending on the internet.\nAlong with disease detection, the system monitors soil moisture, temperature, humidity, and light conditions, and uses weather information to provide intelligent recommendations. Edge AI analyzes these parameters to optimize irrigation, reduce water wastage, and improve crop health. The system also supports offline-first operation and provides farmer-friendly multilingual alerts for easy understanding.\nTechnologies, Hardware & Software:\nVEGA Processor Development Board\nTinyML / Edge AI\nCamera Module for disease detection\nSoil Moisture Sensor\nTemperature & Humidity Sensor (DHT11/DHT22)\nLight Sensor (LDR/BH1750).\nESP32 for optional IoT connectivity\nC/C++, Python, TensorFlow Lite for Microcontrollers\nMQTT/Blynk/Web Dashboard	CATALOG	2026-08-08 10:38:34.42	2026-08-08 10:38:34.42	f	4	Agriculture	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	HS0003	Agriculture faces major challenges such as crop diseases, pest attacks, unpredictable weather conditions, and inefficient resource usage. Early detection of crop diseases is difficult, and existing solutions often depend on cloud connectivity, making them less reliable in rural areas.\nAgriShield AI is an Edge AI-based smart agriculture system that focuses on early crop disease detection using TinyML and a camera module. The system performs on-device disease analysis using the VEGA Processor, enabling faster detection without depending on the internet.\nAlong with disease detection, the system monitors soil moisture, temperature, humidity, and light conditions, and uses weather information to provide intelligent recommendations. Edge AI analyzes these parameters to optimize irrigation, reduce water wastage, and improve crop health. The system also supports offline-first operation and provides farmer-friendly multilingual alerts for easy understanding.\nTechnologies, Hardware & Software:\nVEGA Processor Development Board\nTinyML / Edge AI\nCamera Module for disease detection\nSoil Moisture Sensor\nTemperature & Humidity Sensor (DHT11/DHT22)\nLight Sensor (LDR/BH1750).\nESP32 for optional IoT connectivity\nC/C++, Python, TensorFlow Lite for Microcontrollers\nMQTT/Blynk/Web Dashboard	\N	\N	Agricultural Technology	AgriShield AI	{TinyML,"Edge AI","VEGA Processor",ESP32,C/C++,Python,"TensorFlow Lite"}	Hybrid	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{}	["Improved crop health", "Reduced water wastage", "Increased efficiency in resource usage"]	\N	{}	\N	\N	{}	1	The proposal does not cover the economic analysis of the system's implementation and maintenance.	\N	{"Programming skills in C/C++ and Python","Knowledge of machine learning and embedded systems"}	{}	\N	{}	{}	{}	{"Machine learning","Embedded systems","IoT development","Agricultural technology"}	Edge AI-based smart agriculture system for early crop disease detection and resource optimization	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	NORMAL
